@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
allowmixing
title Template example — Communication diagram: numbered object messages
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

object "client : Caller" as C
object "handler : PublishRevisionHandler" as H
object "store : GuardedPublicationStore" as S
object "draft : ResumeDraft" as D
C --> H : 1: publish(intent)
H --> S : 1.1: coordinate current admission + identity
S --> D : 1.2: snapshot(expected version), if new eligible intent
S --> S : 1.3: coherent commit, if snapshot valid
S --> H : 1.4: attributable actual outcome
H --> C : 1.5: permitted projection

@enduml
